Relay Lab modifications:
  The adaptation files contain parameter tensors for original SmolVLA modules,
  fitted for the project's simulated cloth workcell. Depending on the recorded
  adapter format, these include the native state projection, action-input and
  action-time projections, action-output projection, and final action-expert
  feed-forward and normalization modules. They do not add a replacement action
  network. Per-arm normalization, action-frame metadata, and inference settings
  accompany the tensors. The adapter metadata identifies the exact saved module
  scope and training provenance; this notice does not assert task performance.

Distribution scope:
  This directory distributes adaptation artifacts, not the complete pretrained
  model or its full vision/language backbone weights. The pinned upstream model
  must be obtained separately. Some original native parameter tensors are
  retained alongside modified tensors so the adapter can be installed exactly.

